# License scope

This repository publishes the processed audio assets used by Dawnwave
(https://github.com/maxweilun1989/dawnwave, private source repo).

## bowl/*  (Tibetan singing bowl)

SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-SA-4.0
License text: LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt
Canonical URL: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Original work: "Tibetan Singing Bowl hit 11inch.flac"
Author: דג בלי מלח (Wikimedia Commons user)
Source: https://commons.wikimedia.org/
Modifications by Dawnwave: trim, loop preparation, gradual-wake envelope,
loudness normalisation, mono conversion, CAF/48 kHz rewrite.
These derivative audio files are distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0.

## piano/*  (equivalent piano note)

